    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical but not deeply passionate about it—more like a tool for understanding the world. My lower secondary education gave me basics, but I’ve used it in daily life like budgeting and cooking. I don’t see it as abstract theory but as problem-solving with real-world applications.",
